# Pairs with NoStaleAuthority. The rebuild compiles a cached view rather than
# scanning the registry, so it clears the out-of-date mark without picking up
# the write.
MODULE: RebuildStartReadsOldRegistry
TARGET: NoStaleAuthority
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a rebuild republishes the snapshot it already had
PERTURBS: RebuildStart

--- FIND
    /\ snapVer' = [snapVer EXCEPT ![s] = regVer]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the registry is not rescanned.
    /\ snapVer' = snapVer
--- END
